{
  "activity": "ExcelReadRange",
  "package": "UiPath.Excel.Activities",
  "coded": [
    {
      "call": "{@IWorkHandle}.ReadRange",
      "args": {
        "sheetName": "{SheetName}",
        "range": "{Range}",
        "addHeaders": "{AddHeaders}",
        "preserveFormat": "{PreserveFormat}"
      },
      "returns": "DataTable",
      "defaults": {
        "AddHeaders": true,
        "PreserveFormat": false,
        "Range": {
          "lit": ""
        }
      },
      "usings": [
        "UiPath.Excel.Activities.API"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "ignore": [
    "UseFilter"
  ],
  "notes": "ExcelOperations.ReadRange(this IWorkHandle, string sheetName, string range, bool addHeaders, bool preserveFormat)。UseFilter（フィルターで見えている行だけ読む）は API に無いので捨てる（フィルターをかけたブックの結果が XAML と変わる）。AddHeaders の既定はアクティビティと同じ true"
}
